      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Previously, Marina asked former mayor Arkady about the millions in bribe money that Osipenko is pursuing. Now, Arkady playfully wonders whether their conversation is being recorded, while Marina demands complete honesty if they are to have any relationship.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Какой у вас интересный вопрос!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Ну, допустим, эти деньги есть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "И где же они спрятаны?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
